WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.925
Here's Microsoft's starting point.

2
00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:06.459
Learn's Az PowerShell for protecting the
hierarchy sets two things on the tenant

3
00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:10.181
root group: that creating a
management group needs authorization,

4
00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:12.550
and which group new subscriptions land in.

5
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.813
Learn's REST reference reads
both back with one call.

6
00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:20.738
The guide assigns the security benchmark
and the FedRAMP initiative in DoNotEnforce,

7
00:00:20.738 --> 00:00:23.474
which evaluates compliance
without enforcing.

8
00:00:23.474 --> 00:00:28.464
And two more REST references give the
reads the kit needs: diagnostic settings,

9
00:00:28.464 --> 00:00:32.071
with the workspace and the
log categories each one sends,

10
00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:35.590
and Defender for Cloud's
pricings, with each plan's tier.
